      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> that needs\nto be populated through <a href=\"#register(java.lang.Class...)\"><code>register(Class...)</code></a> calls and then manually\n<a href=\"ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html#refresh()\">refreshed</a>.",
