    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>, deriving\nbean definitions from the given annotated classes and automatically refreshing the\ncontext.",
