    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>, scanning\nfor bean definitions in the given packages and automatically refreshing the\ncontext.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>，扫描给定包中的 Bean 定义并自动刷新上下文。",
      "count": 3
