    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> with the\ngiven <code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code>. The context needs to be populated through\n<a href=\"#register(java.lang.Class...)\"><code>register(Class...)</code></a> calls and then manually <a href=\"ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html#refresh()\">refreshed</a>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的带有给定<code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code>的<a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>。该上下文需要通过<a href=\"#register(java.lang.Class...)\"><code>register(Class...)</code></a>调用进行填充，然后手动<a href=\"ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html#refresh()\">刷新</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Create a new <a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a> with the\ngiven <code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code>.",
      "translation": "创建一个新的<a href=\"AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.web.server.reactive.context\"><code>AnnotationConfigReactiveWebServerApplicationContext</code></a>，使用给定的<code>DefaultListableBeanFactory</code>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Perform a scan within the specified base packages. Note that <a href=\"ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.html#refresh()\"><code>ReactiveWebServerApplicationContext.refresh()</code></a>\nmust be called in order for the context to fully process the new class.",
