    {
      "source": "<code>annotatedClasses</code> - one or more annotated classes, e.g. <code>@Configuration</code>\nclasses",
      "translation": "<code>annotatedClasses</code> - 一个或多个已注解的类，例如 <code>@Configuration</code> 类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>basePackages</code> - the packages to check for annotated classes",
      "translation": "<code>basePackages</code> - 要检查已注解类的包",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates given environment to underlying <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader</code></a> and\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner</code></a> members.",
      "translation": "委托给底层 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner</code></a> 成员的环境。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Note: In case of multiple <code>@Configuration</code> classes, later <code>@Bean</code>\ndefinitions will override ones defined in earlier loaded files. This can be leveraged\nto deliberately override certain bean definitions through an extra Configuration class.",
      "translation": "注意：如果有多个 `<code>@Configuration</code>` 类，后来加载的 `<code>@Bean</code>` 定义将覆盖早期文件中定义的 Bean。这可以通过额外的配置类来故意覆盖某些 Bean 定义。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Default is\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotationBeanNameGenerator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotationBeanNameGenerator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认值为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotationBeanNameGenerator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotationBeanNameGenerator</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The default is an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotationScopeMetadataResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotationScopeMetadataResolver</code></a>.",
      "translation": "默认值为一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotationScopeMetadataResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotationScopeMetadataResolver</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Calls to <code>#register</code> are idempotent; adding the same annotated class more\nthan once has no additional effect.",
      "translation": "对 `<code>#register</code>` 的调用是幂等的；多次添加同一个已标注的类不会产生额外效果。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Provide a custom <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanNameGenerator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanNameGenerator</code></a> for use with\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader</code></a> and/or\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner</code></a>, if any.",
      "translation": "提供自定义的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanNameGenerator.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanNameGenerator</code></a> 供 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>AnnotatedBeanDefinitionReader</code></a> 和/或 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ClassPathBeanDefinitionScanner</code></a> 使用（如有）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ScopeMetadataResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ScopeMetadataResolver</code></a> to use for detected bean classes.",
      "translation": "将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/annotation/ScopeMetadataResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context.annotation\"><code>ScopeMetadataResolver</code></a> 设置为用于检测到的 Bean 类。",
      "count": 1
